// Title: Potential Product Class Reconnaissance Via Wmic.EXE
// Rule ID: e568650b-5dcd-4658-8f34-ded0b1e13992
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1047, attack.discovery, attack.t1082
// Category: process_creation
